WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.595 --> 00:00:07.316
Meet Lucy.

2
00:00:08.436 --> 00:00:09.957
She is a beautiful caterpillar.

3
00:00:11.598 --> 00:00:13.599
One morning she saw Sally Spider.

4
00:00:13.619 --> 00:00:15.200
"Hi, Sally!

5
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.281
What are you doing today?"

6
00:00:17.781 --> 00:00:18.482
asked Lucy.

7
00:00:18.502 --> 00:00:22.084
"I am spinning a web to catch some lunch.

8
00:00:22.464 --> 00:00:24.285
Do you want to spin a web with me?"

9
00:00:25.165 --> 00:00:25.986
Sally asked.

10
00:00:26.006 --> 00:00:29.888
"Oh, I'd like to spin with you.

11
00:00:30.284 --> 00:00:33.006
But I think I have too many legs!"

12
00:00:33.487 --> 00:00:34.287
said Lucy.

13
00:00:34.307 --> 00:00:36.829
"That's true.

14
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.072
I only have eight legs," said Sally.

15
00:00:40.092 --> 00:00:42.474
"But you have sixteen!

16
00:00:42.894 --> 00:00:50.501
Wow." Lucy laughed and said, "Yeah, they help me hold on to branches better."

17
00:00:50.521 --> 00:00:54.484
"I've got to keep spinning," said Sally.

18
00:00:54.504 --> 00:00:56.626
"See you later, Lucy!"

19
00:00:58.227 --> 00:00:59.408
Lucy said good-bye.

20
00:01:00.828 --> 00:01:02.549
Then she met Anthony Ant.

21
00:01:02.569 --> 00:01:04.370
"Hi, Anthony!

22
00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.290
What are you doing today?"

23
00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:07.331
she asked.

24
00:01:07.351 --> 00:01:11.032
"I'm carrying food back to my house.

25
00:01:11.552 --> 00:01:14.454
I will save it until winter," Anthony said.

26
00:01:15.914 --> 00:01:17.395
Lucy was very impressed.

27
00:01:18.155 --> 00:01:19.916
"I save my food too.

28
00:01:20.256 --> 00:01:22.517
But I save it inside my body."

29
00:01:22.537 --> 00:01:25.758
"That's very smart!"

30
00:01:26.398 --> 00:01:27.159
Anthony said.

31
00:01:27.179 --> 00:01:30.020
"Hi, Lucy!"

32
00:01:30.408 --> 00:01:32.669
said a bee, drinking from a daisy.

33
00:01:32.689 --> 00:01:35.271
"Hi, Bert!

34
00:01:35.751 --> 00:01:37.372
What are you doing today?"

35
00:01:37.772 --> 00:01:38.492
Lucy asked.

36
00:01:38.512 --> 00:01:42.054
"I'm collecting pollen to share with the queen bee.

37
00:01:42.414 --> 00:01:43.255
Do you want some?"

38
00:01:43.715 --> 00:01:44.456
Bert asked.

39
00:01:44.476 --> 00:01:47.597
"No, thank you.

40
00:01:48.017 --> 00:01:49.458
I ate my lunch already.

41
00:01:49.878 --> 00:01:51.319
Look at these leaves!

42
00:01:51.799 --> 00:01:52.980
Aren't they delicious?"

43
00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:54.201
asked Lucy.

44
00:01:54.221 --> 00:01:57.062
"Uh, sure!

45
00:01:57.402 --> 00:01:58.503
But I'd rather eat honey.

46
00:01:58.923 --> 00:02:00.084
See you tomorrow, Lucy!"

47
00:02:00.928 --> 00:02:03.449
And Bert flew off to a flower far away.

48
00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:08.590
Can you guess Lucy's favorite hobby?

49
00:02:09.611 --> 00:02:11.191
That's right, it's eating!

50
00:02:11.951 --> 00:02:15.953
She needs to eat a lot of leaves because she stores her food in her body.

51
00:02:20.054 --> 00:02:22.174
ate so many leaves today!

52
00:02:22.695 --> 00:02:27.156
Maybe I will go someplace quiet and take a nap," thought Lucy.

53
00:02:28.308 --> 00:02:31.470
"Oh, and sleeping upside down sounds comfortable.

54
00:02:32.211 --> 00:02:33.392
I'm sleepy."

55
00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:37.434
Lucy started to snore.

56
00:02:38.775 --> 00:02:42.518
Lucy is sleepy because she is about to make a big change!

57
00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:51.404
After eating many leaves for many months, she will shed her caterpillar skin and form a hard shell

58
00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:52.565
called a chrysalis.

59
00:02:53.465 --> 00:02:56.828
Inside her chrysalis, she will sleep for a long time.

60
00:02:57.624 --> 00:02:59.265
Can you guess what happens next?

61
00:02:59.285 --> 00:03:02.267
"Hey, Sally.

62
00:03:02.587 --> 00:03:04.208
Have you seen Lucy lately?"

63
00:03:05.048 --> 00:03:05.788
asked Anthony.

64
00:03:05.808 --> 00:03:08.290
"No, Anthony.

65
00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:11.071
I haven't seen Lucy for two weeks!"

66
00:03:11.631 --> 00:03:12.412
Sally said.

67
00:03:12.432 --> 00:03:16.174
"Bert, have you seen Lucy?"

68
00:03:17.074 --> 00:03:17.735
"No, Sally.

69
00:03:18.055 --> 00:03:19.256
I haven't seen her either."

70
00:03:19.976 --> 00:03:21.357
Bert was very worried.

71
00:03:25.879 --> 00:03:27.360
think we should go look for her.

72
00:03:28.216 --> 00:03:29.617
Do you want to come with me?"

73
00:03:30.537 --> 00:03:31.297
Anthony asked.

74
00:03:32.898 --> 00:03:34.859
"Yes!" said Bert and Sally.

75
00:03:35.899 --> 00:03:37.540
They flew and crawled after him.

76
00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.861
"Look, Anthony!

77
00:03:40.241 --> 00:03:42.082
There are Lucy's clothes!"

78
00:03:42.642 --> 00:03:43.522
cried Sally.

79
00:03:44.143 --> 00:03:45.983
She pointed at Lucy's old skin.

80
00:03:47.284 --> 00:03:49.165
Bert looked at Lucy's hard shell.

81
00:03:49.185 --> 00:03:52.286
"Why, it must be an evil monster!

82
00:03:52.686 --> 00:03:53.787
I think it ate Lucy!"

83
00:03:54.767 --> 00:03:56.228
He knocked on the monster's shell.

84
00:03:58.076 --> 00:03:58.637
"Excuse me.

85
00:03:59.077 --> 00:03:59.477
Open up.

86
00:03:59.797 --> 00:04:01.198
Did you eat my friend, Lucy?

87
00:04:01.218 --> 00:04:04.661
Hello?" Suddenly the chrysalis opened.

88
00:04:10.785 --> 00:04:12.787
asked all three friends, confused.

89
00:04:12.807 --> 00:04:15.228
"You're beautiful!"

90
00:04:15.909 --> 00:04:16.609
said Sally.

91
00:04:16.629 --> 00:04:20.912
"Thanks. So you like my new wings?"

92
00:04:21.373 --> 00:04:22.493
said Lucy, smiling.

93
00:04:22.514 --> 00:04:24.775
"I sure do!"

94
00:04:25.255 --> 00:04:26.692
said Bert.

95
00:04:26.712 --> 00:04:28.854
"Will you join me for some leaves and pollen?"

96
00:04:28.874 --> 00:04:37.182
"Sorry, Bert, but I have to fly across the field and lay over a hundred eggs!"

97
00:04:37.662 --> 00:04:38.343
said Lucy.

98
00:04:38.363 --> 00:04:40.825
"For once I'm not hungry!

99
00:04:41.225 --> 00:04:43.047
All I want to do is fly!"

100
00:04:43.868 --> 00:04:47.531
Lucy floated off into the distance, and her friends cheered.

101
00:04:48.292 --> 00:04:51.194
"Bye, Lucy!

102
00:04:51.355 --> 00:04:52.416
We'll miss you!"
